# Caddy reverse proxy (deployment.md). Compose passes EPILOGUE_HOST in; unset → localhost
# (Caddy's internal CA). Set it to the server's full MagicDNS name
# (<machine>.<tailnet>.ts.net) and Caddy fetches the cert from tailscaled over the mounted
# /var/run/tailscale socket — needs HTTPS certificates enabled for the tailnet.
# Browser → web; /api is handled inside Next (the BFF proxy), so only the web tier is exposed.
{$EPILOGUE_HOST:localhost} {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
